    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37587" root="لح" body-key="l">
    
      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَحْلَحُوا</span></b> , (K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَحْلَحُوا</span></b> , (S,
K,) <i>They remained fixed,</i> or <i>firm, in their place;
did not quit it.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَحْلَحَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a
camel) <i>stayed, and remained fixed,</i> or <i>firm.</i> (L.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلحلحوا</span></b>  <i>They became dispersed;</i>
formed by transposition from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحلحلوا</span>. (L.)

